> approve
Prepare a launch plan for the product guide.

- The plan identifies the target audience.
- The plan links the approved guide.
- The plan lists launch risks and owners.

# launch
>
> launch-plan
Execute the approved product launch.

- The launch only starts after a complete launch plan exists.
- The result records the launch date and owner.

